{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psych Rift is an action-adventure set in a secret research facility overtaken by a dark entity, where you must survive reality-breaking encounters, terrifying monsters and impossible mazes. Avoid deadly traps, solve puzzles with physics, and employ peculiar devices in a one-of-a-kind adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/a5fb42d29d6d835947edf9c774a35cd4.poster.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/a5fb42d29d6d835947edf9c774a35cd4.webm?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/a5fb42d29d6d835947edf9c774a35cd4.mp4?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi and thank you for checking out the game! Psych Rift is currently in development, and I would very much like to get in touch  with players interested in the project. If you want to find out more or have a chat, please join the Psych Rift server on Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/2ade5bed796afb6bc5facb967cec2990.poster.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/2ade5bed796afb6bc5facb967cec2990.webm?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/2ade5bed796afb6bc5facb967cec2990.mp4?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/7ea1bb7978f3d21f7f51828024237310.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the dark corridors of a deserted military facility. A place once dedicated to the research of psychic warfare and dream manipulation. You have no memory of arriving here, only the growing dread that something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the complex, scattered research logs and corrupted tapes slowly reveal the truth: the experiments went too far. The researchers tore open a psychic rift: a doorway to something vast, intelligent, and utterly malevolent. The entity that emerged did not destroy the facility. It claimed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff became its playthings. Puppets trapped in looping horrors of their own making, their dreams and nightmares spilling into physical reality. Now, you are its latest experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality itself twists against you, as you navigate terrifying encounters and impossible mazes. Every step deeper drags you closer to the entity\u2019s mind, and further from your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horrors. Escape the rift. Or lose yourself to the madness forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/eaad55fe85ec54017a442da9a7e1607c.poster.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/eaad55fe85ec54017a442da9a7e1607c.webm?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/eaad55fe85ec54017a442da9a7e1607c.mp4?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psych Rift promises to be an unforgettable supernatural experience, taking you through various nightmare-turned-reality environments. You will encounter powerful monsters and ghosts, which you will have to defeat or avoid, armed only with your wit and your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally you may stumble upon strange devices which will grant you otherworldly abilities to aid you on your journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4093640?t=1769247112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/acfa1c10187cb5cf4bac2b7c61d50b1479c2a24c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769247112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/eb70a6c76fe7ca339b8c827b7c52c1f79e1782cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769247112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/eb70a6c76fe7ca339b8c827b7c52c1f79e1782cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769247112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psych Rift is an action-adventure set in a secret research facility overtaken by a dark entity, where you must survive reality-breaking encounters, terrifying monsters and impossible mazes. Avoid deadly traps, solve puzzles with physics, and employ peculiar devices in a one-of-a-kind adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/a5fb42d29d6d835947edf9c774a35cd4.poster.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/a5fb42d29d6d835947edf9c774a35cd4.webm?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/a5fb42d29d6d835947edf9c774a35cd4.mp4?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi and thank you for checking out the game! Psych Rift is currently in development, and I would very much like to get in touch  with players interested in the project. If you want to find out more or have a chat, please join the Psych Rift server on Discord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/2ade5bed796afb6bc5facb967cec2990.poster.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/2ade5bed796afb6bc5facb967cec2990.webm?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/2ade5bed796afb6bc5facb967cec2990.mp4?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/7ea1bb7978f3d21f7f51828024237310.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the dark corridors of a deserted military facility. A place once dedicated to the research of psychic warfare and dream manipulation. You have no memory of arriving here, only the growing dread that something is watching you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the complex, scattered research logs and corrupted tapes slowly reveal the truth: the experiments went too far. The researchers tore open a psychic rift: a doorway to something vast, intelligent, and utterly malevolent. The entity that emerged did not destroy the facility. It claimed it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The staff became its playthings. Puppets trapped in looping horrors of their own making, their dreams and nightmares spilling into physical reality. Now, you are its latest experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality itself twists against you, as you navigate terrifying encounters and impossible mazes. Every step deeper drags you closer to the entity\u2019s mind, and further from your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the horrors. Escape the rift. Or lose yourself to the madness forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/eaad55fe85ec54017a442da9a7e1607c.poster.avif?t=1769247112\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/eaad55fe85ec54017a442da9a7e1607c.webm?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/extras/eaad55fe85ec54017a442da9a7e1607c.mp4?t=1769247112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psych Rift promises to be an unforgettable supernatural experience, taking you through various nightmare-turned-reality environments. You will encounter powerful monsters and ghosts, which you will have to defeat or avoid, armed only with your wit and your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Occasionally you may stumble upon strange devices which will grant you otherworldly abilities to aid you on your journey.</p>","developers":["Ablaze Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093640/7838ec2b3753c9b17e1b485a5fbe75e38afaecec/header.jpg?t=1769247112","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093640/508536980/619fd90e6e32c4aeedf5fb0711e3e650c3ee97ec/1759905550/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769247111","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093640/508536980/619fd90e6e32c4aeedf5fb0711e3e650c3ee97ec/1759905550/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769247111","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093640/508536980/619fd90e6e32c4aeedf5fb0711e3e650c3ee97ec/1759905550/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769247111","id":257214118,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257214118/19e169b851bd1b90941bcc77b073939930bf3ec2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1769247111"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093640/594485174/f4c3734a89656186859919af422a2085b9d83f26/1769244660/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769245432","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093640/594485174/f4c3734a89656186859919af422a2085b9d83f26/1769244660/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769245432","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4093640/594485174/f4c3734a89656186859919af422a2085b9d83f26/1769244660/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769245432","id":257271826,"name":"Reality-bending preview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st